{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"35b622c45caac2e2143deec13d5057ff1c10b7bb4ffcc2b67c5ae9089322de61","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_751046cf1217f118f1beeb572cbaf72d57aa650f7b33339f65856495a86f0345","overall_assessment":"The paper presents a clear and well-organized structure, with a logical flow from the introduction of the problem to the proposed method, theoretical background, and experimental results. The writing is generally concise and readable, with specialized terms and assumptions clearly defined. The mathematical notation is consistent and well-explained, and the figures and tables are properly labeled and aid in understanding the results. However, there are a few areas where the clarity could be improved, such as the detailed explanation of the generator network's architecture and the specific hyperparameters used in the experiments.","paper_id":"S1xXiREKDB","paper_identity_sha256":"ba7b6a417b6872451e223166932540cc3dc74f51b2390c17857991d6def65264","prompt_identity_sha256":"bba73d5d49e20d3bf30cb962afd949f5923e83f6f780879a33a2c4f1777e13f8","raw_response_sha256":"d3c785be5c922c6f717016271fb6b167527cf866ea0d73b5ac17e027ee48e7cd","request_identity_sha256":"39e5dfeea6448f78dd7f99a6d619e9ac4301c52af17155bd690f0d708311e6af","reviewer_identity_sha256":"c1cd7c7fdd4a2cbeb45c2f21af982ad0f30bffae8ae148e3eba36479685cf360","role":"CLAR","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"8fcd5811e518e63cb760acf34e23d3ad7af543bb0489bbe3bfbfc14f622d9026","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001","SRC-002","SRC-003","SRC-004","SRC-005","SRC-006","SRC-007","SRC-008","SRC-009","SRC-010","SRC-011","SRC-012","SRC-013","SRC-014","SRC-015","SRC-016","SRC-017","SRC-018","SRC-019","SRC-020","SRC-021","SRC-022","SRC-023","SRC-024","SRC-025","SRC-026","SRC-027","SRC-028","SRC-029","SRC-030","SRC-031","SRC-032","SRC-033","SRC-034","SRC-035","SRC-036","SRC-037","SRC-038","SRC-039","SRC-040"],"review_text":"The paper is well-structured and the narrative flows smoothly from the introduction to the conclusion. The specialized terms and assumptions are clearly defined and consistently used. The algorithm presentation is clear, with the minimax game between the classifier and the perturbation generator network well-explained. However, the detailed architecture of the generator network and the specific hyperparameters used in the experiments could be more explicitly described to aid in reproducibility.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-WRT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-010","SRC-011","SRC-012","SRC-013","SRC-014","SRC-015","SRC-016","SRC-017","SRC-018","SRC-019"],"review_text":"The mathematical notation is consistent and well-defined. The equations are clearly presented, and the derivations are well-explained. The use of symbols such as theta, phi, and delta is consistent throughout the paper. The theoretical background section provides a clear explanation of the minimax optimization problem and its equivalence to minimizing the adversarial loss. However, the transition from the theoretical derivation to the practical implementation could be more explicitly detailed.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-NOT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-013","SRC-014","SRC-024","SRC-025","SRC-026","SRC-027","SRC-028","SRC-029","SRC-030","SRC-031","SRC-032","SRC-033","SRC-034"],"review_text":"The figures and tables are properly labeled and aid in understanding the results. The caption text for Figure 1 provides a clear description of the adversarial robustness with the perturbation generating network. The caption text for Figure 2 explains the Gaussian normal distribution and the conceptual illustration of the adversarial training. The caption text for Figure 4 and Figure 5 provides detailed descriptions of the robustness-curve and the relationship between benign accuracy and rho_cw. The Markdown table in Table 1 is readable and provides a clear comparison of the performance of the conventional adversarial training algorithms and the proposed algorithm. However, the specific details of the hyperparameters used in the experiments could be more explicitly described in the figure captions or the main text.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-FIG"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"5cfb0233d75b54f29cddf7a6f7597d5723d27774ab6dbb8e1fe4ee432cb39b87","paper_id":"S1xXiREKDB","paper_ordinal":105,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"d3c785be5c922c6f717016271fb6b167527cf866ea0d73b5ac17e027ee48e7cd","attempt_index":0,"error":"","finish_reason":"stop","paper_id":"S1xXiREKDB","raw_provider_response_base64":"","raw_provider_response_sha256":"5ada85ed9c7cfcfb60b5636961b376cf92fb763bb5db974fac96e1cf98999c05","request_identity_sha256":"39e5dfeea6448f78dd7f99a6d619e9ac4301c52af17155bd690f0d708311e6af","role":"CLAR","schema_version":"no-memory-full-review-corpus-build-v5","usage":{"completion_tokens":1151,"prompt_tokens":19537,"prompt_tokens_details":null,"total_tokens":20688},"valid":true}],"request_identity_sha256":"39e5dfeea6448f78dd7f99a6d619e9ac4301c52af17155bd690f0d708311e6af","role":"CLAR","role_ordinal":1,"schema_version":"corpus-build-bootstrap-checkpoint-v4"}